---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import CTABand from '../components/CTABand.astro';
import TestimonialSlot from '../components/TestimonialSlot.astro';
---
<Base
  title="For India-based buyers | Salet"
  description="Buying UK property from India. Salet is your representative on the ground: viewings, verification, negotiation, completion and ongoing care, with one accountable point of contact."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="For India-based buyers"
    title="Buying in the UK from India comes down to one question: who do you trust on the ground?"
    lede="A child starting university, a family move on the horizon, or simply a sterling asset in a stable market. The intent is clear. The distance is the problem. Salet exists to be your eyes, your hands and your representative in the UK."
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">
    <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="prose-salet lg:col-span-7">
        <h2>Remote buying fails at the verification step</h2>
        <p>
          Anyone can send you a portal link. What you cannot do from thousands of miles away is stand in the property, hear
          the traffic, see the damp patch behind the wardrobe, or read the room in a negotiation. Photographs are
          marketing. Video calls show what the person holding the phone chooses to show.
        </p>
        <p>
          The UK process also assumes presence: viewings at short notice, surveyors to instruct, solicitors who post
          documents, completion days with keys to collect. Without someone accountable on the ground, each step
          becomes a favour asked of a relative or a leap of faith with a stranger.
        </p>
        <h2>What Salet does for remote buyers</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Represents only you.</strong> We hold no listings and take nothing from sellers. Our fee comes from you, so our advice answers to you.</li>
          <li><strong>Views and verifies in person.</strong> Every shortlisted property is walked, photographed and reported honestly, including the reasons to say no.</li>
          <li><strong>Analyses like an institution.</strong> Comparable sales, street-level pricing, leasehold and title flags, realistic running costs.</li>
          <li><strong>Negotiates and progresses.</strong> Offer strategy, survey interpretation, solicitor chasing, completion handled.</li>
          <li><strong>Signposts the cross-border practicalities.</strong> The identity and source-of-funds documentation UK lawyers will ask of you, and introductions to currency and mortgage specialists. We advise on property; we do not give financial or tax advice.</li>
          <li><strong>Stays after completion.</strong> Management oversight and vacant property care are being introduced, so the asset is looked after when you are not here.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>One point of contact, in your evening hours</h2>
        <p>
          You deal with the founder directly, on WhatsApp and on calls scheduled around the time difference. One
          person accountable from first call to keys, and afterwards.
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="reveal border border-line bg-ivory-2/60 p-8 lg:p-10">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-green-2">A good fit if</p>
          <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone">
            <li>You are buying at £250,000 or above, for family use or as a long-term hold</li>
            <li>Funds are in place, with source-of-funds documentation available</li>
            <li>You want one accountable representative rather than a chain of intermediaries</li>
            <li>You expect honest reports, including the ones that say do not buy this</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-6 text-xs leading-relaxed text-mist">
            Salet does not market properties or investment schemes. If you are looking for guaranteed returns, we are
            not the right firm.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal reveal-d1 mt-8">
          <TestimonialSlot context="Words from India-based clients will appear here as engagements complete." />
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABand
    title="Start with a call in your time zone"
    body="A 30 minute discovery call, scheduled for Indian evening hours if that suits. Your situation, the process, and the honest economics of buying from abroad."
  />
</Base>
